    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d337-f1" n="1" xml:id="d337-f1-content">
                <p>Special Assistant to the Under Secretary of State.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d337-f2" n="2" xml:id="d337-f2-content">
                <p>Director of the Office of Public Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d337-f3" n="3" xml:id="d337-f3-content">
                <p>In a memorandum for the record, September 9, Rusk stated that Lovett had
                    indicated that he approved the paper as a planning guide within the Department
                    of State, not as a final position for immediate action (Policy Planning Staff
                    Files).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
